config FINGERPRINT_GOODIX_GF3208
	tristate "Goodix GF3208 fingerprint driver (nx549j)"
	depends on INPUT_FINGERPRINT
	help
	  Say Y here to enable the Goodix GF3208 fingerprint sensor driver
	  for Nubia Z11 mini S (nx549j / MSM8953). Uses SoC platform bus
	  with GPIO IRQ/RST/PWR. Requires Nubia-signed trustlet for full
	  biometric functionality.
